<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9820"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 9:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->A friend told me yesterday &#40;don&#39;t ask who&#41; that Rader has belongs, jewerly etc buried in his back yard, that&#39;s how LE knew there where more vics. I never really thought about it, thought everyone know that&#39;s where he hid it. So how come I am the only on to hear this?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
