<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10074"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Foxfire<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Foxfire<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 9:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Are those headphones for a tape recorder or are those the ear protectors one wears at a firing range?  Anyway, either/or it&#39;s  sort of creepy. <BR> <BR>And silly me is worrying about who&#39;s feeding and watering the poor dog!  lol! <BR> <BR>Which reminds me, just about the one thing I got right in My profile was that he was with a dog.  Little did I know he was around LOTS of dogs at different times!  lol! <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
