<!--Post: 10201--><!--Time: 1109812502-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10201"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:blingbling1169@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Cawichitan<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cawichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 5:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good observation, Lilymarie!I figured someone would have one laying around their yard or something and this weirdo has one on a table in his back yard!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10201-->
<!--Post: 10228--><!--Time: 1109828756-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10228"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 9:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Looking at photos of Denny&#39;s pad all I can say is... <BR> <BR>WHAT A DUMP! It’s a white trash cabin! <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kstatecollegian.com/articles/1109570400/view/lead.front.jpg" target=_top>http://www.kstatecollegian.com/articles/1109570400 /view/lead.front.jpg</a> <BR> <BR>I count at least 16 code violations in this area alone. <BR> <BR>Did you see the BTK slideshow on Yahoo? Check out slide 4 of 38. <BR> <BR>Look closely… do you see what I see? <BR> <BR>HIS FREAKIN CHRISTMAS LIGHTS ARE STILL UP!!!  <BR> <BR>Does his dog have rabies too? <BR> <BR>The code enforcing, grass measuring Barney of Park City has Christmas Lights up on February 25th!... and his back yard looks like a scenic backdrop for “The Further Adventures of Ma &amp; Pa Kettle”. <BR> <BR>For Pete’s sake! Jeffrey Dahmer showed more pride of ownership. <BR> <BR>I know Denny… I know… you were going to get those lights down first thing Saturday morning. <BR> <BR>MERRY XMAS buttneck! <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10228-->
<!--Post: 10233--><!--Time: 1109831701-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10233"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bestbud<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bestbud<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 10:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It&#39;s been unseasonably cold in Kansas with snow, sleet, rain, a severe ice storm and temps in the 20&#39;s and below still. Keep in mind that the grass goes dormant in the winter in Kansas; thus, the &#34;grunge&#34; look. Actually, the house looks quite &#34;tidy&#34; from the pics I&#39;ve seen...   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10233-->
<!--Post: 10234--><!--Time: 1109832249-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10234"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Foxfire<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Foxfire<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 10:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t think his house looks oh so bad either.  However, those who live in glass houses shouldn&#39;t throw . . . ugh . . . bricks. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10234-->
<!--Post: 10237--><!--Time: 1109833638-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10237"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 11:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><i>&#34;HIS FREAKIN CHRISTMAS LIGHTS ARE STILL UP!!!</i> <BR> <BR>Why I also made note of this odd detail, I&#39;m not sure. <BR> <BR>I did feel before he was found that we&#39;d find he was an overly meticulous sort, but that he&#39;d probably have one thing he just neglected - his teeth, his body odor, something like that. Maybe his thing was something stupid like the Christmas lights.  <BR> <BR><i>&#42;Files &#34;buttneck&#34; away in mental dictionary, sure to find a reason to use it in the future...&#42;</i><!--/Text--></td></tr>
